imeout.","error":"The API gateway did not receive a timely response from the upstream service. Please try again shortly.","path":"/v1/manga/1/statistics"}}}}}}},"operationId":"getMangaByIdStatistics"}},"/manga/{id}/statistics/history":{"get":{"summary":"Manga Statistics History","tags":["Manga"],"description":"Day-by-day history of the manga's score, members, rank, popularity and favorites, together with its statistics page (status counts and score votes) on the days it was read. Newest day first.\n\n- `score`, `scored_by`, `rank`, `popularity`, `members` and `favorites`: every day since March 7, 2026.\n- `statistics` (reading, completed, on hold, dropped, plan to read, and the votes per score): since April 4, 2026, for manga with 1,000 or more members. Read every day from 5,000 members, every other day below that, and `null` on a day without a read.","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"integer","default":1,"minimum":1,"maximum":20000},"in":"query","name":"page","required":false,"description":"Page number","examples":{"default":{"value":1,"x-disabled":true}}},{"schema":{"type":"integer","default":25,"minimum":1,"maximum":100},"in":"query","name":"limit","required":false,"description":"Results per page","examples":{"default":{"value":25,"x-disabled":true}}},{"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["desc","asc"],"default":"desc","x-enumDescriptions":{}},"in":"query","name":"sort","required":false,"description":"`desc` lists the newest day first, `asc` the oldest day first.","examples":{"default":{"value":"desc","x-disabled":true}}},{"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"in":"query","name":"start_date","required":false,"description":"Only days on or after this date (UTC). Format: YYYY-MM-DD."},{"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"in":"query","name":"end_date","required":false,"description":"Only days on or before this date (UTC). Format: YYYY-MM-DD."},{"schema":{"type":"integer","default":1},"in":"path","name":"id","required":true,"description":"The MAL Manga ID"}