,"description":"Genre classifications of the manga."},"explicit_genres":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"A reference to another metadata catalog entry (such as a studio, author, genre, or theme).","properties":{"mal_id":{"type":"integer","description":"The unique MyAnimeList ID of the catalog item."},"type":{"type":"string","description":"The type of the catalog item (e.g., anime, manga, people)."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the catalog item."},"url":{"type":"string","description":"The MyAnimeList website link for this catalog item."}}},"description":"Always empty, kept for Jikan compatibility: MAL lists Ecchi, Erotica and Hentai among a manga's genres, so they are in `genres`. `/genres/manga?filter=explicit_genres` lists those three."},"themes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"A reference to another metadata catalog entry (such as a studio, author, genre, or theme).","properties":{"mal_id":{"type":"integer","description":"The unique MyAnimeList ID of the catalog item."},"type":{"type":"string","description":"The type of the catalog item (e.g., anime, manga, people)."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the catalog item."},"url":{"type":"string","description":"The MyAnimeList website link for this catalog item."}}},"description":"Theme classifications."},"demographics":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","description":"A reference to another metadata catalog entry (such as a studio, author, genre, or theme).","properties":{"mal_id":{"type":"integer","description":"The unique MyAnimeList ID of the catalog item."},"type":{"type":"string","description":"The type of the catalog item (e.g., anime, manga, people)."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the catalog item."},"url":{"type":"string","description":"The MyAnimeList website link for this catalog item."}}},"description":"Demographic classifications (e.g. Shonen, Seinen, Shojo)."}}}}},"example":{"pagination":{"last_visible_page":1,"has_next_page":false,"current_page":1,"items":{"count":18,"total":18,"per_page":25}},"data":[{"mal_id":26027,"url":"https://myanimelist.net/manga/26027/Mahoutsukai_no_Yoru","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/manga/1/63637.jpg","small_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/manga/1/63637t.jpg","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/manga/1/63637l.jpg"},"webp":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/manga/1/63637.webp","small_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/manga/1/63637t.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/manga/1/63637l.webp"}},"approved":true,"titles":[{"type":"Default","title":"Mahoutsukai no Yoru"},{"type":"Japanese","title":"魔法使いの夜"},{"type":"English","title":"Witch on the Holy Night"},{"type":"Synonym","title":"A Magician's Night"},{"type":"Synonym","title":"MahoYo"}],"title":"Mahoutsukai no Yoru","title_english":"Witch on the Holy Night","title_japanese":"魔法使いの夜","title_synonyms":["A Magician's Night","MahoYo"],"type":"Light Novel","chapters":8,"volumes":1,"status":"Finished","publishing":false,"published":{"from":"2012-04-12T00:00:00+00:00","to":null,"prop":{"from":{"day":12,"month":4,"year":2012},"to":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null}},"string":"Apr 12, 2012"},"score":8.71,"scored_by":1445,"rank":67,"popularity":2941,"members":8795,"favorites":274,"synopsis":"It is the late 1980s. Rumors of a witch living inside an old mansion circulate in the city. Unbeknownst to observers, living inside the mansion is an actual witch, Alice Kuonji, a stoic woman and a magus hiding in the present day. Under her tutelage studies Aoko Aozaki, a high school student studying magecraft as the head of the Aozaki family. As magi, the two of them secretly fight any threat that enters their town.\n\nThings start to change when a young man unfamiliar with city life, Soujuurou Shizuki, enters their lives. Slowly, he affects the lives of these two magi. And so their story begins...\n\n(Source: TV Tropes)","background":null,"authors":[{"mal_id":3250,"type":"people","name":"Nasu, Kinoko","url":"https://myanimelist.net/people/3250/Kinoko_Nasu","role":"Story"}],"serializations":[],"genres":[{"mal_id":7,"type":"manga","name":"Mystery","url":"https://myanimelist.net/manga/genre/7/Mystery"},{"mal_id":37,"type":"manga","name":"Supernatural","url":"https://myanimelist.net/manga/genre/37/Supernatural"}],"explicit_genres":[],"themes":[],"demographics":[]}]},"required":["data","pagination"]}}}},"304":{"description":"Not Modified - the response has not changed since the ETag sent in If-None-Match","headers":{"ETag":{"description":"Identifies this version of the response. Send it in If-None-Match to check whether it has changed.","schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad Request - Invalid parameters or request body","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","type","message","error","path"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"integer","enum":[400]},"type":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}}},"examples":{"invalidParameter":{"summary":"Invalid parameter","value":{"status":400,"type":"BadRequestException","message":"querystring/limit must be <= 100","error":"Check the request parameters against the documentation and try again.","path":"/v1/manga/deleted?limit=101"}},"nginx":{"summary":"Nginx ingress response","value":{"status":400,"type":"BadRequestException","message":"Bad request.","error":"The request is malformed or not shaped like a supported Tenrai API request.","path":"/v1/manga/deleted"}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized - the supplied X-Server-Key is invalid; restricted endpoints also require a Server Key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","type","message","error","path"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"integer","enum":[401]},"type":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"}