n!","title_japanese":"どうも、好きな人に惚れ薬を依頼された魔女です。","title_synonyms":["Horemajo"],"type":"TV","source":"Light novel","episodes":12,"status":"Currently Airing","airing":true,"aired":{"from":"2026-10-05T00:00:00+00:00","to":null,"prop":{"from":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2026},"to":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null}},"string":"Oct 5, 2026 to ?"},"duration":"23 min per ep","rating":"PG-13 - Teens 13 or older","score":7.35,"scored_by":2812,"rank":2904,"popularity":4221,"members":39603,"favorites":71,"synopsis":"Deep within the forest, a cozy and rather cluttered cottage sits on the lakeshore, housing a mysterious, feared witch. In truth, she is a lovely young woman named Rose, who has learned the art of potion-making from her wise grandmother. Rose cherishes her tucked-away life, yet there is a longing in her heart—for a handsome knight she once saw, Sir Harij Azm.\n\nFor four years, Rose's feelings for Harij have lingered, but she can never act on them; witches live outside of human affairs and belong to no country or man. So, when Harij suddenly appears on her doorstep looking for a love potion, Rose is both surprised and heartbroken. Although another woman has captured the noble knight's heart, Rose decides to help him. But before crafting the potion, Rose sends Harij on a series of ridiculous quests for each ingredient, hoping to delay the inevitable and savor their fleeting time together.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","background":null,"season":"fall","year":2026,"broadcast":{"day":"Mondays","time":"21:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"Mondays at 21:30 (JST)"},"producers":[{"mal_id":143,"type":"anime","name":"Mainichi Broadcasting System","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/143/Mainichi_Broadcasting_System"},{"mal_id":238,"type":"anime","name":"AT-X","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/238/AT-X"},{"mal_id":1377,"type":"anime","name":"Futabasha","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1377/Futabasha"},{"mal_id":1680,"type":"anime","name":"BS NTV","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1680/BS_NTV"},{"mal_id":1696,"type":"anime","name":"Kadokawa","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1696/Kadokawa"},{"mal_id":2074,"type":"anime","name":"Bit grooove promotion","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/2074/Bit_grooove_promotion"},{"mal_id":2147,"type":"anime","name":"Heart Company","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/2147/Heart_Company"},{"mal_id":3408,"type":"anime","name":"Sand B","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/3408/Sand_B"}],"licensors":[],"studios":[{"mal_id":51,"type":"anime","name":"Diomedéa","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/51/Diomedéa"}],"genres":[{"mal_id":10,"type":"anime","name":"Fantasy","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/10/Fantasy"},{"mal_id":22,"type":"anime","name":"Romance","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/22/Romance"}],"explicit_genres":[],"themes":[],"demographics":[{"mal_id":43,"type":"anime","name":"Josei","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/43/Josei"}]}]},"required":["data","pagination"]}}}},"304":{"description":"Not Modified - the response has not changed since the ETag sent in If-None-Match","headers":{"ETag":{"description":"Identifies this version of the response. Send it in If-None-Match to check whether it has changed.","schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad Request - Invalid parameters or request body","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","type","message","error","path"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"integer","enum":[400]},"type":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}}},"examples":{"invalidParameter":{"summary":"Invalid parameter","value":{"status":400,"type":"BadRequestException","message":"querystring/limit must be <= 100","error":"Check the request parameters against the documentation and try again.","path":"/v1/schedules?limit=101"}},"nginx":{"summary":"Nginx ingress response